 d=\"M14 14.74V4a2 2 0 1 0-4 0v10.74a5 5 0 1 0 4 0z\"/></svg>\n                        <h3>Gas Refilling</h3>\n                        <p>Low cooling often indicates low refrigerant. We provide precise <strong>water cooler gas filling vadodara</strong> using eco-friendly refrigerants.</p>\n                    </div>\n\n                    <div class=\"service-card\">\n                        <!-- Icon: Settings -->\n                        <svg class=\"service-icon\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"3\"/><path d=\"M19.4 15a1.65 1.65 0 0 0 .33 1.82l.06.06a2 2 0 0 1 0 2.83 2 2 0 0 1-2.83 0l-.06-.06a1.65 1.65 0 0 0-1.82-.33 1.65 1.65 0 0 0-1 1.51V21a2 2 0 0 1-2 2 2 2 0 0 1-2-2v-.09A1.65 1.65 0 0 0 9 19.4a1.65 1.65 0 0 0-1.82.33l-.06.06a2 2 0 0 1-2.83 0 2 2 0 0 1 0-2.83l.06-.06a1.65 1.65 0 0 0 .33-1.82 1.65 1.65 0 0 0-1.51-1H3a2 2 0 0 1-2-2 2 2 0 0 1 2-2h.09A1.65 1.65 0 0 0 4.6 9a1.65 1.65 0 0 0-.33-1.82l-.06-.06a2 2 0 0 1 0-2.83 2 2 0 0 1 2.83 0l.06.06a1.65 1.65 0 0 0 1.82.33H9a1.65 1.65 0 0 0 1-1.51V3a2 2 0 0 1 2-2 2 2 0 0 1 2 2v.09a1.65 1.65 0 0 0 1 1.51 1.65 1.65 0 0 0 1.82-.33l.06-.06a2 2 0 0 1 2.83 0 2 2 0 0 1 0 2.83l-.06.06a1.65 1.65 0 0 0-.33 1.82V9a1.65 1.65 0 0 0 1.51 1H21a2 2 0 0 1 2 2 2 2 0 0 1-2 2h-.09a1.65 1.65 0 0 0-1.51 1z\"/></svg>\n                        <h3>AMC Services</h3>\n                        <p>Sign up for our <strong>water cooler amc vadodara</strong> packages. Regular maintenance prevents breakdowns during peak summer.</p>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </section>\n\n        <!-- Brands Section -->\n        <section class=\"content-block container\">\n            <div class=\"section-title\">\n                <h2>Brands We Service</h2>\n                <p>We provide expert repair for all major brands available in Gujarat and online markets.</p>\n            </div>\n            <p style=\"text-align: center; max-width: 800px; margin: 0 auto;\">\n                Whether you own a branded unit or a locally assembled SS body cooler, our technicians have the schematics and spare parts availability. We are experts in handling:\n            </p>\n            <div class=\"brands-cloud\">\n                <div class=\"brand-tag\">Voltas</div>\n                <div class=\"brand-tag\">Blue Star</div>\n                <div class=\"brand-tag\">Usha</div>\n                <div class=\"brand-tag\">Carrier</div>\n                <div class=\"brand-tag\">Lloyd</div>\n                <div class=\"brand-tag\">Sidwal</div>\n                <div class=\"brand-tag\">Sheetal</div>\n                <div class=\"brand-tag\">Vidiem</div>\n                <div class=\"brand-tag\">Symphony</div>\n                <div class=\"brand-tag\">Local Fabricated Coolers</div>\n            </div>\n        </section>\n\n        <!-- Pros and Cons Section -->\n        <section class=\"content-block bg-light\">\n            <div class=\"container\">\n                <div class=\"section-title\">\n                    <h2>Why Choose Professional Repair? (Pros &#038; Cons)</h2>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"pros-cons-container\">\n                    <div class=\"pros\">\n                        <h3>Pros of Choosing Atlas Aircon</h3>\n                        <div class=\"list-item\">\n                            <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"green\" stroke-width=\"2\"><polyline points=\"20 6 9 17 4 12\"></polyline></svg>\n                            <p><strong>Expertise:</strong> Access to certified water cooler technician vadodara with years of experience.</p>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"list-item\">\n                            <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"green\" stroke-width=\"2\"><polyline points=\"20 6 9 17 4 12\"></polyline></svg>\n                            <p><strong>Speed:</strong> Same day water cooler service vadodara ensures minimal downtime.</p>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"list-item\">\n                            <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"green\" stroke-width=\"2\"><polyline points=\"20 6 9 17 4 12\"></polyline></svg>\n                            <p><strong>Genuine Parts:</strong> We use only authentic water cooler spare parts vadodara.</p>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"list-item\">\n                            <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"green\" stroke-width=\"2\"><polyline points=\"20 6 9 17 4 12\"></polyline></svg>\n                            <p><strong>Warranty:</strong> Service warranty provided on compressor and gas filling.</p>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"list-item\">\n                            <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"green\" stroke-width=\"2\"><polyline points=\"20 6 9 17 4 12\"></polyline></svg>\n                            <p><strong>Safety:</strong> Proper handling of electrical components and refrigerants.</p>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"list-item\">\n                            <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"green\" stroke-width=\"2\"><polyline points=\"20 6 9 17 4 12\"></polyline></svg>\n                            <p><strong>Cost-Effective:</strong> Preventive maintenance reduces long-term repair costs.</p>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"list-item\">\n                            <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"green\" stroke-width=\"2\"><polyline points=\"20 6 9 17 4 12\"></polyline></svg>\n                            <p><strong>Hygiene:</strong> thorough cleaning of tanks prevents waterborne diseases.</p>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n\n                    <div class=\"cons\">\n                        <h3>Cons of Ignoring Maintenance</h3>\n                        <div class=\"list-item\">\n                            <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"red\" stroke-width=\"2\"><line x1=\"18\" y1=\"6\" x2=\"6\" y2=\"18\"></line><line x1=\"6\" y1=\"6\" x2=\"18\" y2=\"18\"></line></svg>\n                            <p><strong>Higher Bills:</strong> A faulty compressor consumes 30% more electricity.</p>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"list-item\">\n                            <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"red\" stroke-width=\"2\"><line x1=\"18\" y1=\"6\" x2=\"6\" y2=\"18\"></line><line x1=\"6\" y1=\"6\" x2=\"18\" y2=\"18\"></line></svg>\n                            <p><strong>Health Risks:</strong> Algae buildup in uncleaned tanks causes illness.</p>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"list-item\">\n                            <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"red\" stroke-width=\"2\"><line x1=\"18\" y1=\"6\" x2=\"6\" y2=\"18\"></line><line x1=\"6\" y1=\"6\" x2=\"18\" y2=\"18\"></line></svg>\n                            <p><strong>Water Wastage:</strong> Ignored leaks can waste hundreds of liters daily.</p>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"list-item\">\n                            <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"red\" stroke-width=\"2\"><line x1=\"18\" y1=\"6\" x2=\"6\" y2=\"18\"></line><line x1=\"6\" y1=\"6\" x2=\"18\" y2=\"18\"></line></svg>\n                            <p><strong>Total Failure:</strong> Small noises often lead to total motor burnout.</p>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"list-item\">\n                            <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"red\" stroke-width=\"2\"><line x1=\"18\" y1=\"6\" x2=\"6\" y2=\"18\"></line><line x1=\"6\" y1=\"6\" x2=\"18\" y2=\"18\"></line></svg>\n                            <p><strong>Business Disruption:</strong> No cold water impacts employee morale.</p>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"list-item\">\n                            <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"red\" stroke-width=\"2\"><line x1=\"18\" y1=\"6\" x2=\"6\" y2=\"18\"></line><line x1=\"6\" y1=\"6\" x2=\"18\" y2=\"18\"></line></svg>\n                            <p><strong>Safety Hazards:</strong> Water near electrical parts is a shock risk.</p>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"list-item\">\n                            <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"red\" stroke-width=\"2\"><line x1=\"18\" y1=\"6\" x2=\"6\" y2=\"18\"></line><line x1=\"6\" y1=\"6\" x2=\"18\" y2=\"18\"></line></svg>\n                            <p><strong>Short Lifespan:</strong> Lack of AMC reduces the machine&#8217;s life by years.</p>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </section>\n\n        <!-- Price Table -->\n        <section class=\"content-block container\">\n            <div class=\"section-title\">\n                <h2>Service Price List (Vadodara)</h2>\n                <p>Transparent pricing for honest work. Contact us for bulk industrial quotes.</p>\n            </div>\n            <table class=\"price-table\">\n                <thead>\n                    <tr>\n                        <th>Service Description</th>\n                        <th>Estimated Price Range (INR)</th>\n                    </tr>\n                </thead>\n                <tbody>\n                    <tr>\n                        <td><strong>Visiting &#038; Inspection Charge</strong></td>\n                        <td>₹299 &#8211; ₹499</td>\n                    </tr>\n                    <tr>\n                        <td><strong>Water Cooler Service &#038; Cleaning</strong></td>\n                        <td>₹550 &#8211; ₹1,200</td>\n                    </tr>\n                    <tr>\n                        <td><strong>Gas Refilling (Commercial)</strong></td>\n                        <td>₹1,800 &#8211; ₹3,500</td>\n                    </tr>\n                    <tr>\n                        <td><strong>Thermostat Replacement</strong></td>\n                        <td>₹850 &#8211; ₹1,500</td>\n                    </tr>\n                    <tr>\n                        <td><strong>Fan Motor Repair/Replace</strong></td>\n                        <td>₹1,200 &#8211; ₹2,800</td>\n                    </tr>\n                    <tr>\n                        <td><strong>Compressor Replacement</strong></td>\n                        <td>₹4,500 &#8211; ₹15,000 (Depends on Capacity)</td>\n                    </tr>\n                    <tr>\n                        <td><strong>Capillary &#038; Filter Change</strong></td>\n                        <td>₹450 &#8211; ₹950</td>\n                    </tr>\n                    <tr>\n                        <td><strong>Water Tap Replacement (SS/Brass)</strong></td>\n                        <td>₹350 &#8211; ₹850</td>\n                    </tr>\n                </tbody>\n            </table>\n            <p style=\"font-size: 0.9rem; color: #666;\">*Prices may vary based on model, brand, and spare part availability.</p>\n        </section>\n\n        <!-- Buy/Sell/Scrap Section -->\n        <section class=\"content-block bg-light\">\n            <div class=\"container\">\n                <div class=\"section-title\">\n                    <h2>Used Water Cooler Buy, Sell &#038; Scrap</h2>\n                </div>\n                <div style=\"display: flex; gap: 30px; align-items: center; flex-wrap: wrap;\">\n                    <div style=\"flex: 1;\">\n                        <img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://atlasaircons.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/07/deep-freezer-repair-service-in-vadodara.webp\" alt=\"Old Water Cooler Scrap Vadodara\" style=\"border-radius: 8px;\" title=\"\">\n                    </div>\n                    <div style=\"flex: 2;\">\n                        <p>Looking to upgrade your industrial setup? We also facilitate the purchase and sale of second-hand water coolers in Vadodara. If your old unit is beyond repair, we offer the best <strong>scrap value for water coolers</strong>. We pick up old units from GIDC areas, offices, and homes, offering instant payment.</p>\n                        <ul style=\"margin-top: 20px;\">\n                            <li>✅ Best price for used Blue Star/Voltas coolers.</li>\n                            <li>✅ Refurbished water coolers for sale with warranty.</li>\n                            <li>✅ Eco-friendly disposal of scrap units.</li>\n                        </ul>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </section>\n\n        <!-- Common Error Codes -->\n        <section class=\"content-block container\">\n            <div class=\"section-title\">\n                <h2>Common Water Cooler Error Codes &#038; Solutions</h2>\n            </div>\n            <table class=\"price-table\">\n                <thead>\n                    <tr>\n                        <th>Issue / Symptom</th>\n                        <th>Possible Cause</th>\n                        <th>Recommended Action</th>\n                    </tr>\n                </thead>\n                <tbody>\n                    <tr>\n                        <td><strong>Water Not Cooling</strong></td>\n                        <td>Gas leakage, Compressor failure, or Thermostat issue.</td>\n                        <td>Check if the compressor is vibrating. If not, call a technician immediately.</td>\n                    </tr>\n                    <tr>\n                        <td><strong>Excessive Noise</strong></td>\n                        <td>Loose fan blade, vibrating pipes, or uneven floor.</td>\n                        <td>Tighten screws and ensure the cooler is on a level surface.</td>\n                    </tr>\n                    <tr>\n                        <td><strong>Water Leakage</strong></td>\n                        <td>Damaged tank seam, loose tap, or overflow pipe block.</td>\n                        <td>Turn off the water inlet and inspect the float valve.</td>\n                    </tr>\n                    <tr>\n                        <td><strong>Electric Shock</strong></td>\n                        <td>Earthing issue or exposed wiring touching the body.</td>\n                        <td><strong>DANGER:</strong> Switch off immediately and call an electrician or our expert.</td>\n                    </tr>\n                </tbody>\n            </table>\n        </section>\n\n        <!-- Locations Served -->\n        <section class=\"content-block bg-light\">\n            <div class=\"container\">\n                <div class=\"section-title\">\n                    <h2>Areas We Serve in Vadodara</h2>\n                </div>\n                \n                <div class=\"location-box\">\n                    <h3 style=\"color: var(--secondary-color); margin-bottom: 15px;\">Residential Areas</h3>\n                    <div class=\"location-tags\">\n                        <span>Alkapuri</span> <span>Akota</span> <span>Sayajigunj</span> <span>Raopura</span> <span>Mandvi</span> <span>Nyay Mandir</span> <span>Lehripura</span> <span>Panigate</span> <span>Wadi</span> <span>Fatehpura</span> <span>Yakutpura</span> <span>Nagarwada</span> <span>Dandia Bazar</span> <span>Khanderao Market</span> <span>Pratapgunj</span> <span>Fatehgunj</span> <span>Nizampura</span> <span>Chhani</span> <span>Chhani Jakat Naka</span> <span>Sama</span> <span>Sama-Savli Road</span> <span>Vemali</span> <span>Karelibaug</span> <span>Warasiya</span> <span>Harni</span> <span>Harni-Warasia Ring Road</span> <span>Motnath Mahadev</span> <span>Vip Road</span> <span>New Vip Road</span> <span>Ajwa Road</span> <span>Waghodia Road</span> <span>Bapod</span> <span>Bakrawadi</span> <span>Kishanwadi</span> <span>Soma Talav</span> <span>Tarsali</span> <sp