n>Vishwamitri Station Area</span>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"location-box\">\n                    <h3 style=\"color: var(--secondary-color); margin-bottom: 15px;\">Industrial Areas (GIDC &#038; Parks)</h3>\n                    <div class=\"location-tags\">\n                        <span>Makarpura GIDC</span> <span>Nandesari GIDC</span> <span>Waghodia GIDC</span> <span>Por GIDC</span> <span>Ramangamdi GIDC</span> <span>Savli GIDC</span> <span>Manjusar GIDC</span> <span>Ranoli GIDC</span> <span>Sardar Industrial Estate (Ajwa Road)</span> <span>Gorwa BIDC</span> <span>Gorwa Industrial Area</span> <span>Bapod Industrial Area</span> <span>Yamuna Mill Industrial Area (Dabhoi Road)</span> <span>Chhani Industrial Area</span> <span>Petrochemical Complex (IPCL/PCC) Area</span> <span>Koyali Refinery Area</span> <span>Kotambi Industrial Park</span> <span>Jarod Industrial Area</span> <span>Samlaya Industrial Area</span> <span>Tundav Industrial Area</span> <span>Lamdapura Industrial Area</span> <span>Muval Industrial Area</span> <span>Desar Industrial Area</span> <span>Sanvadodara GIDC</span> <span>Dabhoi GIDC</span> <span>Pavi-Jetpur GIDC</span> <span>Bodeli Industrial Area</span> <span>Padra Industrial Area</span> <span>Ekalbara Industrial Area</span> <span>Jambusar Road Industrial Zone</span> <span>Atladra Industrial Area</span> <span>Sokhada Industrial Area</span> <span>Dashrath Industrial Estate</span> <span>Bajwa Industrial Area</span> <span>Karjan Industrial Area</span> <span>Miyagam Karjan GIDC</span> <span>Vadsar Industrial Area</span> <span>Maneja Industrial Area</span> <span>Maretha Industrial Zone</span> <span>Nexus Industrial Park (Kotambi)</span> <span>Shah Industrial Park (Kotambi/Manjusar)</span> <span>Brushellz Industrial Park (Chhani)</span> <span>Avani Industrial Park</span> <span>Krishna Industrial Park (Halol Highway)</span> <span>Gokul Industrial Estate</span> <span>Fortune Industrial Park (Savli)</span> <span>Halol GIDC</span> <span>Kalol GIDC</span> <span>Baska Industrial Area</span> <span>Tajpura Industrial Area</span>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </section>\n\n        <!-- FAQs Section -->\n        <section class=\"content-block container\">\n            <div class=\"section-title\">\n                <h2>Frequently Asked Questions</h2>\n            </div>\n            \n            <div class=\"faq-item\">\n                <div class=\"faq-question\">1. How quickly can you attend to a water cooler repair near me in Vadodara?</div>\n                <div class=\"faq-answer\">We prioritize urgent requests, especially for corporate and industrial clients. In most cases within city limits like Alkapuri, Akota, or Makarpura, we offer same-day service.</div>\n            </div>\n\n            <div class=\"faq-item\">\n                <div class=\"faq-question\">2. Do you repair industrial water coolers in Savli or Waghodia GIDC?</div>\n                <div class=\"faq-answer\">Yes, our team is fully equipped to travel to all major industrial zones including Savli, Waghodia, Por, and Nandesari GIDC for heavy-duty cooler repairs.</div>\n            </div>\n\n            <div class=\"faq-item\">\n                <div class=\"faq-question\">3. Why is my water cooler not cooling despite the fan running?</div>\n                <div class=\"faq-answer\">This usually indicates a compressor failure or gas leakage. The fan cools the condenser, but the compressor cools the water. Call us for a leak check and gas refilling.</div>\n            </div>\n\n            <div class=\"faq-item\">\n                <div class=\"faq-question\">4. What is the cost of water cooler gas filling in Vadodara?</div>\n                <div class=\"faq-answer\">Gas filling charges depend on the capacity of the cooler (e.g., 40L, 80L, 150L). Generally, it starts from ₹1500 for commercial units.</div>\n            </div>\n\n            <div class=\"faq-item\">\n                <div class=\"faq-question\">5. Do you provide Annual Maintenance Contracts (AMC)?</div>\n                <div class=\"faq-answer\">Yes, we offer comprehensive AMC plans for schools, colleges, factories, and offices. This includes periodic cleaning and preventive checks.</div>\n            </div>\n\n            <div class=\"faq-item\">\n                <div class=\"faq-question\">6. Can you fix water leaking from the tap area?</div>\n                <div class=\"faq-answer\">Absolutely. Tap leakage is a common issue. We can replace the washers or the entire tap assembly with high-quality brass or SS taps.</div>\n            </div>\n\n            <div class=\"faq-item\">\n                <div class=\"faq-question\">7. Do you use genuine spare parts for Blue Star/Voltas coolers?</div>\n                <div class=\"faq-answer\">Yes, we source genuine compressors, thermostats, and filters compatible with major brands to ensure the longevity of your appliance.</div>\n            </div>\n\n            <div class=\"faq-item\">\n                <div class=\"faq-question\">8. My water cooler is giving a shock. What should I do?</div>\n                <div class=\"faq-answer\">Switch off the main power supply immediately! Do not touch the water or body. This is a serious electrical fault requiring professional attention.</div>\n            </div>\n\n            <div class=\"faq-item\">\n                <div class=\"faq-question\">9. Is it worth repairing an old water cooler or should I buy new?</div>\n                <div class=\"faq-answer\">If the tank is rusted or the compressor has failed multiple times, we might suggest buying a new or refurbished one. We can inspect and give an honest recommendation.</div>\n            </div>\n\n            <div class=\"faq-item\">\n                <div class=\"faq-question\">10. How do I book a service?</div>\n                <div class=\"faq-answer\">You can click the WhatsApp button on this page or call us directly at +91 97272 57141 to schedule a visit.</div>\n            </div>\n        </section>\n\n    </main>\n\n    <!-- Footer -->\n    <footer>\n        <div class=\"container\">\n            <div class=\"footer-grid\">\n                <div class=\"footer-col\">\n                    <h4>About Atlas Aircon</h4>\n                    <p>Vadodara&#8217;s leading HVAC and refrigeration service provider. Trusted by thousands of homes and industries for reliable repairs and maintenance.</p>\n                    <br>\n                    <p><strong>Address:</strong> Vadodara, Gujarat (Pin: 390005)</p>\n                    <p><strong>Phone:</strong> +91 97272 57141</p>\n                    <p><strong>Email:</strong> atlasaircon1@gmail.com</p>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"footer-col\">\n                    <h4>Our Services</h4>\n                    <ul class=\"footer-links\">\n                        <li><a href=\"/ac-repair-vadodara\">AC Repair Services</a></li>\n                        <li><a href=\"/chiller-repair-services-vadodara\">Chiller Repair</a></li>\n                        <li><a href=\"/cold-room-repair-services-vadodara\">Cold Room Repair</a></li>\n                        <li><a href=\"/deep-freezer-repair-services-vadodara\">Deep Freezer Repair</a></li>\n                        <li><a href=\"/water-cooler-repair-services-vadodara\">Water Cooler Repair</a></li>\n                        <li><a href=\"/hvac-repair-services-vadodara\">HVAC Solutions</a></li>\n                        <li><a href=\"/ducting-repair-services-vadodara\">Ducting Services</a></li>\n                    </ul>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"footer-col\">\n                    <h4>More Links</h4>\n                    <ul class=\"footer-links\">\n                        <li><a href=\"/panel-ac-service-vadodara\">Panel AC Service</a></li>\n                        <li><a href=\"/cassette-ac-service-vadodara\">Cassette AC Service</a></li>\n 